lue": "Combine these cards with those from expansion packs to power up your own unique deck!<br>\r\nThis box contains a game set for one player.<br>\r\n\u2022 It includes one half-deck/30-card set (13 basic energy cards + 12 Pok\u00e9mon cards + 5 trainer cards). <br>\r\n\u2022\u00a0The Pok\u00e9mon cards are randomly selected in each box. <br>\r\n\u2022 The basic energy cards and trainer cards are the same in each box.<br>\r\n\u2022 Also included are: 1 sheet of damage counters/markers, 1 Pok\u00e9mon coin, and 1 instruction booklet.\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nReleased 12/1/2001"}]}]}